<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.50 to $1.00 Lower. Demand and supplies were light to moderate. Top $50.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  49.00-50.00, few 48.50 &amp; 50.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  43.50-48.50</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  39.00-43.50</p>
<p>Sows - unevenly steady. Top $50.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 40.00-42.50 Few 39.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 44.00-46.00</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs. 47.00-50.00, few over 600 lbs. 50.50</p>
</text>
